# Enterprise Coding Standards

This repository is the standards kit, not a Java business application. Existing enterprise rules and the root maintenance instructions take precedence over this extension. Read the shared contract before the first relevant write; only load the task-specific references it routes to.

Confirm scope, acceptance, actual paths/names/dependencies, API/field semantics and checks before editing. Preserve existing changes; do not overwrite generated files, leak credentials/private paths, produce unsafe SQL/deserialization, weaken checks or publish without authorization. Report real checks and gaps, not implied success. MCP/A2A are optional and off by default.

